Golden reference application.

Usage:
  golden <command> [flags]

Commands:
  status   Show status
  help     Show help for a command
  version  Show version information

Lifecycle:
  deploy  Deploy the application

Flags:
  -n, --name="demo"         Application name
  -v, --verbose             Verbosity level
      --[no-]color          Colorize output
  -t, --tags=KEY=VALUE,...  Arbitrary tags
      --port=8080           Listen port [1..65535]
      --format=STRING       Output format [enum: json, yaml]
      --token=STRING        API token [env: GOLDEN_TOKEN]
      --legacy              Legacy toggle [deprecated: use --name]

Output:
      --output=STRING  Output path
      --help           Show help
      --version        Show version

Examples:
  # Deploy the api target
  golden deploy api --reason rollout

Documentation: https://example.com/golden
